## 🔌 API Endpoints

### Authentication Required

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Rate Limit |
|--------|----------|-------------|------------|
| `POST` | `/index` | Index a repository | 10/min |
| `POST` | `/search` | Search indexed code | 60/min |
